      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Quality of life changes for non-operators\n\n- **Showing a drone icon** in nametag (like with earmuff mode) to indicate that the user is in FPV drone mode and might not hear people around them, would improve interactions between operators and non-operators and reduce misunderstandings",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
